          "citation": "DU Case 31 ★ Canalised-item impossibility; implied term",
          "unitNumber": 8,
          "unit": "Topic 8: Discharge of Contract & Doctrine of Frustration (S. 56)",
          "file": "Contract/Topic-8_Discharge-of-Contract_DU-Notes.html",
