          "number": "Q10",
          "marks": "10 marks",
          "question": "Q10. Discuss P R Transport Agency v UOI on (a) ouster clauses and Art. 226, (b) natural justice in State e-auctions. (10 marks)",
          "unit": "Unit 10: Quasi-Contracts & E-Contracts (Ss. 68–72)",
          "unitNumber": 10,
