          "question": "Q12. Write short notes on: (a) Ss. 4–5, IT Act, (b) Secure e-record / secure e-signature (Ss. 14–16), (c) First Schedule exclusions. (3×5 marks)",
          "unit": "Unit 10: Quasi-Contracts & E-Contracts (Ss. 68–72)",
