          "anchorId": "q12",
          "modelAnswer": "<b>Model answer: (a)</b> S. 4: e-record = writing if electronic + accessible for subsequent reference; S. 5: ES = signature if per Government rules — functional equivalence. <b>(b)</b> S. 14: security procedure applied → deemed secure till verification; S. 15: ES secure if creation data under exclusive control + prescribed manner (evidentiary presumptions, BSA); S. 16: Government prescribes procedures (commercial circumstances). <b>(c)</b> IT Act inapplicable: NI (non-cheque), POA, trust, will, <b>immovable-property sale/conveyance</b> — must use traditional form; favourite trap with S. 10A."
