          "ratio": "Section 3(1)(a) of the 1986 Act must be interpreted reasonably. The husband must make a \"reasonable and fair provision\" for the entire future of the divorced wife, and this provision must be made *within* the iddat period. Maintenance is not limited to the duration of the iddat period; it must extend for the lifetime of the divorced woman or until she remarries."
