          "facts": "Green and others, who held an option over certain assets, formed a company to take over those assets — the vendor-option holders also becoming directors of the new company — and the assets were sold to the company at a price which yielded them a profit . The company sued to recover the profit as a secret profit made in the course of the promotion.",
