          "anchorId": "c5",
          "facts": "The Lagunas Syndicate promoted the Lagunas Nitrate Co.; the properties (nitrate grounds) were sold by the syndicate's nominees to the new company at a price which included the promoters' profit; the syndicate's directors also became directors of the new company. The company later sought relief, alleging that the price was excessive and that the promoters had not made proper disclosure.",
