          "id": "case-u9-1",
          "name": "Madras Bar Association",
          "citation": "Prescribed DU case 32 • WP(C) No. 1072 of 2013 • Supreme Court • 14 May 2015 • Judgment by A.K. Sikri J. • DU printed pp. 294–314",
